Portfolio and Course Material Notice

This repository contains a mixture of student-authored work and course-provided framework material.

The original Delivery Man simulation and testing framework remains the work of its respective authors and Uppsala University course contributors. No license to redistribute or reuse that course-provided material is granted by this repository.

The student-authored A* solution is published here for portfolio review and educational inspection. No permission is granted for submitting this work, in whole or in part, as coursework or for representing it as another person's work.

For reuse beyond personal review, contact the repository owner and, where applicable, the original course-material authors.
